.TH SANCHALA-WINDOW-RULES 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-window-rules \- Per-application window behavior rules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-window-rules
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create rules for window placement, size, and behavior per application.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List all rules
.TP
.B add \fIapp\fR
Create new rule for application
.TP
.B remove \fIrule-id\fR
Remove a rule
.TP
.B edit \fIrule-id\fR
Edit existing rule
.TP
.B detect
Detect window class of clicked window
.SH RULE OPTIONS
\-\-workspace, \-\-position, \-\-size, \-\-maximized, \-\-minimized, \-\-fullscreen, \-\-opacity, \-\-above, \-\-below
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-window-rules add firefox --workspace 2 --maximized
.TP
sanchala-window-rules detect
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
